  Description: "COMPANION / RARE / 1 STAR\r\nTALENT\nAll companion bodies and hitboxes
    are 12% smaller. Presence effect: multiple copies do not shrink them repeatedly.\r\n\nSUPPORT
    WHILE OWNED\nRun / Score multiplier: +2.5%\nChampion / Maximum health: -1\nTier
    1/2/3 traits \xD71/2/4; merging three units reduces support sources.\n\r\n\nLIFE
    IN THE WAITING REALM\nA witness from marshes where reflections remember events
    bodies forget. They disagree with their reflection about a former friend. They
    travel to compare records, not force one witness to disappear.\r\nPERSONAL PASSIVE\nNo
    additional periodic personal passive.\r\n\nNamed talents count bodies and absorbed
    memories; their stated percentages are not multiplied by star level unless explicitly
    stated. Listed support modifiers scale separately at 1/2/4.\r\nBonds: oddity,
    resolve. Immortal. Weapon rolls on recruitment; three equal-species/equal-star
    bodies merge unless the talent forbids it."
